  "summary": "Dwight becomes permanent manager and selects Jim as his assistant, leading Jim to orchestrate a contest that results in Dwight appointing himself as assistant to the assistant. Pam worries that Jim sacrifices his career at Athlead for her, but Jim presents her with documentary footage and a long-withheld note to reaffirm his love. Darryl tries to leave Scranton quietly but is stopped for an emotional farewell dance. Andy crashes an a cappella singing audition and is rejected. Jim convinces Dwight to pursue Angela rather than propose to Esther; Dwight pulls Angela over on the road, proposes, and discovers that baby Phillip is his biological son. The staff gathers at Poor Richard's to watch the documentary premiere."
 },
